    {
      "id": "gv-708404-b00001",
      "text": "The following post is the sixteenth in a series of diaries written by independent filmmaker and feminist scholar Ai Xiaoming and feminist activist Guo Jing. Both are living in Wuhan, at the initial center of the COVID-19 pandemic. Here are the links to the first, second, third, fourth, fifth, sixth, seventh, eighth, ninth, tenth and eleventh, twelfth, thirteenth, fourteenth, and fifteenth parts of the series.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 412,
      "source_links": [
        "https://globalvoices.org/2020/03/21/covid-19-diaries-from-wuhan-not-only-a-city-being-locked-down-but-also-our-voices/",
        "https://globalvoices.org/2020/03/26/covid-19-diaries-from-wuhan-looking-for-human-connection-in-isolation/",
